OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors quit Reform UK after
OL,4,Asuspensions
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Reform UK councillors in Leeds have
OL,7,Fresigned from the party after they were
OL,8,Fsuspended pending an internal
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FDavid Dresser, who represents
OL,12,FKillingbeck and Seacroft, and
OL,13,FPaula-Jane Thackray, of Cross Gates and
OL,14,FWhinmoor, announced they were forming a
OL,15,Fnew political group called Leeds First
OL,16,FIndependents.
OL,18,FLeeds City Council website now lists
OL,19,FThackray as leader of Leeds First
OL,20,FIndependents, with Dresser as deputy
OL,21,Fleader and whip.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
